          "title": "Component Model",
          "body": "S-ART frames mindfulness as training across self-awareness, self-regulation, and self-transcendence rather than as a single capacity. This aligns with the critical claim that mindfulness is an umbrella term whose studies must specify the targeted practices, faculties, interventions, and outcomes."
        },
