          "title": "Mechanisms",
          "body": "A synthesis page should distinguish component mechanisms such as attention regulation, emotion regulation, decentering, non-attachment, prosociality, extinction, and reconsolidation from broad claims about mindfulness as a generic trait or intervention."
        },
        {
          "title": "Measurement Implications",
          "body": "Measurement should be treated cautiously: self-report questionnaires operationalize different facets, and S-ART-style component models imply that research should track specific biological, cognitive, emotional, behavioral, and social changes over time."
        }
