          "body": "S-ART distinguishes experiential enactive, experiential phenomenological, and narrative self-processing systems and proposes that mindfulness can reduce biased narrative self-processing through regulation and decentering."
        },
        {
          "title": "Integrated Experience",
          "body": "Information Integration Theory offers a broader consciousness framework in which subjective experience is tied to integrated informational structure within complexes, with both quantity and quality specified by integrated information and effective-information relationships."
        },
