          "title": "Synthesis Boundary",
          "body": "The shared concept is not that these sources use the same theory, but that both treat conscious subjectivity as structured by relations among specialized processes: S-ART focuses on self-related networks and practice-related modulation, while IIT focuses on integrated complexes and qualia-space structure."
        }
